{
  "abstract": "This is a Lean 4 formalization of the theorem that every Lebesgue measurable subset of the plane with positive upper Banach density contains a translated and rotated copy of every sufficiently large dilate of any fixed noncollinear triangle. The proof was developed using GPT 6 Astra Pro. The Lean formalization was generated by Claude Opus 5.5 Medium.",
